{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/Afluent\/Sci"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Subscribing","level":2,"text":"Subscribing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"code":"for try await","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. It first receives the value that is current at that moment,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then every value sent afterwards, in order; values are buffered for it until it consumes them. Values sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it subscribed are not replayed. A consumer that subscribes after completion receives only the completion."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To subscribe before the consumer’s task runs, make the iterator now and hand it over as an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":tr